commit fe75a42875047ff5f6854e89615e30094e363a8c
Author: kaigani <kaigani@gmail.com>
Date:   Mon Nov 2 12:51:35 2026 -0800

    fix(gate): C22-T2 analyser requires typed environment, one run id, record identity and valid outcomes (C24-R2-03)
    
    OS/arch/profile must be present strings; both inputs carry the same runId (checked
    against TT_EXPECT_RUN_ID in CI) and consistent start times; Flatten records carry
    distinct sampleIds and stroke-add samples are distinct observations; every record of
    both series is a completion or an atomic refusal; oversized numbers exit 2. Producers
    write runId/startedAt/sampleId; builder tests check each refusal's own reason.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

